    "timestamp_utc = start of the minute (UTC). ODS133/ODS165 label the minute at the end of which the estimate was computed: the row hh:mm includes all events of the running quarter-hour up to hh:mm:59, so it becomes usable at hh:mm+1 plus publication lag.",
    "ODS133 columns (*_cum_*, mip/mdp/alpha/price_cum) are cumulative quarter-hour-to-date estimates; the row at minute 14 of a quarter-hour equals the final quarter-hour value (see validation.last_minute_vs_qh).",
